SCREEN (Stage 3, EE 927-996). Wide Passes 1-5 on the full sighted roster (league-shaped only), then the EE 945 cull at the verified Pass-4 cumulative table (4,240/table): survivors gift2 (954), holdfast (896), fastdrift (886), compfield (880), tickparam (875), gift4 (875), plus CONTROL (878) and the baseline arm. Closed at wide depth: scorefocus (528 = 12.5% - the aggressive D4 focus falsified at wide depth, recorded not rescued), hailpair (738), earlyrelease (844), plankeep (820). Deepening Passes 6-19 on the culled roster (tables41deep.txt, 8 league-shaped tables), 1,060 matches per table per pass (Passes 13 and 15 partial at 1,000 - hub tier thermal stand-downs, recorded in state.md; the stood-down shards were never run or fabricated). FINAL CUMULATIVE (wide 1-5 + deepening 6-19; 20,020 per Gen-1 table; baseline seated from Pass 6, 14,720): gift2 4,624 = 23.1% (leader); gift4 4,269 = 21.3%; holdfast 4,189 = 20.9%; fastdrift 4,150 = 20.7%; CONTROL 4,130 = 20.6%; compfield 4,121 = 20.6%; tickparam 4,112 = 20.5%; emise-baseline 1,794 = 12.2%. v33 same-round reference (wide passes only): 20.6% at 5,300. PAIRED-SEED RECORD: gift2's net vs CONTROL was positive in ALL FOURTEEN deepening passes (+23, +37, +16, +29, +13, +29, +30, +29, +36, +35, +31, +24, +18, +37); every other survivor coincided with CONTROL on >= 99% of indices at winner level in nearly every pass; gift4 carried the highest outcome churn throughout. The #2 seat never separated: gift4 vs holdfast closed 80 wins (0.4 points) apart, inside the noise band at this depth. C5 watch: zero player failures and zero NOWINNER in candidate tables across the deepening (one NOWINNER in the baseline arm, Pass 17, recorded).

STAGE 4 TRACES (pulled forward on Will's traces-first ruling, EE ~966; full record top2/gift2-traces.md). 300 traced games per arm, gift2 vs CONTROL, paired, 600/600 hashes matched, zero failures. The S1 mechanism fires exactly as designed: 140 Gift casts donated exactly 140 Burnouts (140/140), the donated clocks fired 185 times on their new owners and killed 17 times; gift2's own self-Burnout deaths fell to 15 = 6.5% of losses vs CONTROL's 33 = 14.5% (and under macromackie's hosted 7.8% and v30's 12.1%). Shape passes all five R37 clauses (pings 525 hero / 0 creature; Post-with-minion 100%; bodies 18.89 = 0.80x replica-Mage in-room; conversion 5.70 = 0.84x; stranded 20.8%, best in room). Learning core engaged: median |theta - theta0| large for relBand and burnBand, movement in 300/300 games; the focus thetas did not move in either arm (the M3 defect, carried to Generation 2). THE WALL DOES NOT MOVE: placement 3.02 vs 3.03, death turn 29.2 vs 29.2. ONE REGRESSION, named: Sharpshooter-held deaths 40.3% of gift2 losses vs CONTROL's 29.4% (still under v30's 47.8%). Traced-sample win share read parity (23.0% vs 24.0%, discordance 18/21); the screen's deeper cumulative is the share evidence of record.

